  "bodyHash": "+Exrm84cSiw=",
  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refined-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此模組需要 Refined Storage</span></a></span></strong></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#000\">如果你想將此模組加入你的模組包，歡迎自由使用 :)<br>此模組新增了更優化的輸出器、輸入器、建造器、破壞器、磁碟介面、自動合成器、介面、請求器，基於 Refined Storage 與 RSRequestify<br><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\">1.20.1 或以下版本：<br></span><span style=\"color:#000\">精英版：額外 9 個過濾欄位，速度提升 2 倍<br></span><span style=\"color:#000\">終極版：額外 27 個過濾欄位，速度提升 5 倍，內建堆疊升級<br></span><span style=\"color:#000\">巨量版：額外 45 個過濾欄位，速度提升 6.5 倍，內建堆疊升級<br><br>1.21.1 或以上版本：<br>精英版：額外 9 個過濾欄位，速度提升 2 倍<br>終極版：額外 27 個過濾欄位，速度提升 5 倍，內建堆疊升級<br>巨量版：額外 45 個過濾欄位，速度提升 8 倍，內建堆疊升級<br></span>創造版：額外 45 個過濾欄位，速度提升 15000 倍，內建堆疊升級</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>特殊功能：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li>標籤過濾</li>\n<li>自動合成的面專屬輸入</li>\n<li>自動合成器的匯入模式</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#000\">輸入器合成配方：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/173/310/172/elite_importer.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/168/310/172/ultra_importer.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/164/310/172/creative_importer.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>輸出器合成配方：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/171/310/172/elite_exporter.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/167/310/172/ultra_exporter.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/163/310/172/creative_exporter.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>建造器合成配方：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/169/310/172/elite_constructor.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/165/310/172/ultra_constructor.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/160/310/172/creative_constructor.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>破壞器合成配方：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/170/310/172/elite_destructor.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/166/310/172/ultra_destructor.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/346/161/310/172/creative_destructor.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>磁碟操作器合成配方：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/389/383/310/172/elite_disk_manipulator.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/389/382/310/172/ultra_disk_manipulator.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/389/381/310/172/creative_disk_manipulator.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>請求器合成配方：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/389/794/310/172/elite_requester.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/389/795/310/172/ultra_requester.png\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/389/792/310/172/creative_requester.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n</div><p><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/WpUmcmUayN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/40115388/ec29dadf15db1421b9984cc1234b28314f448a34.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"381\" height=\"144\"></a></p>",
